    "html": "<p>Star X has a surface temperature <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T\"></span>, luminosity <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span> and radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The luminosity of star Y is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4L\"></span> and the surface temperature is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2T\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the radius of star Y?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{R}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{R}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2R\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4R\"></span></li></ol>"
